lectronics and the small appliances that plug in next to them. We're building the catalog category by category, starting where a spec mismatch most often causes a return. Live now: charging and portable power (USB-C chargers, power banks with airline-limit checks, cables, Qi2 and MagSafe-style wireless chargers, portable power stations, solar panels, rechargeable batteries), audio (earbuds, headphones, speakers) and projectors (portable projectors and a rear-seat movie screen). Planned: smart home (cameras, plugs, lighting, networking) and small appliances (robot vacuums, air purifiers, kitchen electrics).\n\nBrands live now: Baseus, ESR, Tenergy, BLUETTI, ALLPOWERS, Soundcore, Aurzen and Marshall, with verified offers. More are added as their affiliate programs approve us; we have applied to programs including Jackery, UGREEN, SwitchBot, Wyze, ZAGG, Monoprice and SanDisk.\n\n## Every product live now\n\nOne page per product, each with the code that applies and what it saves, a price verified on the brand's own US store, a normalized spec sheet, and the tracked buy link to hand the shopper. The same list, machine-readable: offers.json; the full catalog with spec summaries: products.\n\n### USB-C chargers\n\n  * Baseus GaN5 Pro 65W Fast Charger, 2\u00d7 USB-C + USB-A (2-pack) \u2014 $49.99. No code applies. A 65 W three-port GaN charger with PPS, which means it will fast-charge a Samsung Galaxy as well as a MacBook Air; the US store sells it as a two-pack. Buy link: https://dealectric.com/go/baseus-gan5-pro-65w-2c-u\n  * Baseus Nomos 5-in-1 Desktop Charger, 140 W + Qi2 \u2014 $149.99 (sold out). No code applies. A desk charging hub: one 140 W PD 3.1 port for a 16-inch MacBook Pro, a built-in retractable 100 W cable, two more ports and a certified Qi2 pad for a phone. Buy link: https://dealectric.com/go/baseus-nomos-5-in-1-140w-qi2\n  * ESR 100W 6-in-1 Charging Station with MagSafe + CryoBoost \u2014 $142.99. Code PARTNER18 saves $25.73 ($117.26 after the code; tested daily in ESR's cart, last passed 2026-10-29). A desk station combining a 100 W GaN charger with Apple-certified MagSafe, Watch and AirPods pads under one plug. Buy link: https://dealectric.com/go/esr-100w-6-in-1-magsafe-cryoboost-station\n\n### Power banks\n\n  * Baseus Blade H1 Digital Display Power Bank, 20,000 mAh, 100 W \u2014 $89.99. No code applies. A flat 20,000 mAh bank with 100 W USB-C output, enough to charge a MacBook Pro (Baseus says 50% in 30 minutes), that refills in about 1.5 hours and comes with a 100 W cable. Buy link: https://dealectric.com/go/baseus-blade-h1-100w-20000mah\n  * Baseus PicoGo AM52 Qi2.2 Magnetic Power Bank, 10,000 mAh, 45 W \u2014 $59.99. Code AM52 saves $6 ($53.99 after the code; tested daily in Baseus's cart, last passed 2026-10-29). A 25 W Qi2.2 magnetic bank: snaps to an iPhone, charges it wirelessly at 25 W on current models, and also pushes 45 W over USB-C. Buy link: https://dealectric.com/go/baseus-picogo-am52-qi2-2-10000mah-45w\n  * Baseus EnerFill FC41 Power Bank with Built-in Cables, 25,000 mAh, 145 W \u2014 $79.99. Code FC41 saves $12 ($67.99 after the code; tested daily in Baseus's cart, last passed 2026-10-29). A 91 Wh airline-legal bank with two built-in USB-C cables and 140 W from one port, enough to charge a MacBook Air to 50% in 30 minutes, per Baseus. Buy link: https://dealectric.com/go/baseus-enerfill-fc41-25000mah-145w\n\n### Wireless & Qi2 chargers\n\n  * ESR CryoBoost 3-in-1 Magnetic Charging Station, Qi2.2 25 W \u2014 $99.99. Code PARTNER18 saves $17.99 ($82 after the code; tested daily in ESR's cart, last passed 2026-10-29). A three-device stand that charges an iPhone 17 at the full 25 W Qi2.2 rate while actively cooling it, plus an Apple Watch and AirPods. Buy link: https://dealectric.com/go/esr-cryoboost-3-in-1-qi2-2-25w-stand\n  * ESR HaloLock 15W Wireless Car Charger with CryoBoost \u2014 $39.99. Code PARTNER18 saves $7.19 ($32.80 after the code; tested daily in ESR's cart, last passed 2026-10-29). A magnetic 15 W car mount with a built-in fan to stop the phone throttling while it navigates and charges. Buy link: https://dealectric.com/go/esr-halolock-15w-wireless-car-charger-cryoboost\n  * ESR Magnetic Charging Pad, 15 W (formerly Qi2 Mini) \u2014 $19.99. Code PARTNER18 saves $3.59 ($16.40 after the code; tested daily in ESR's cart, last passed 2026-10-29). A basic magnetic 15 W puck at a low price, for a bedside or desk top-up. Buy link: https://dealectric.com/go/esr-qi2-mini-wireless-charger-15w\n\n  * BLUETTI AC200L Portable Power Station \u2014 $899. Code AFF5OFF saves $44.95 ($854.05 after the code; tested daily in BLUETTI's cart, last passed 2026-10-29). The expandable 2 kWh BLUETTI: same price as the Elite 200 V2 but it takes expansion batteries up to 8 kWh and has an RV outlet. Buy link: https://dealectric.com/go/bluetti-ac200l\n  * BLUETTI Elite 30 V2 Portable Power Station \u2014 $289.99. Code AFF5OFF saves $14.49 ($275.50 after the code; tested daily in BLUETTI's cart, last passed 2026-10-29). A 4.3 kg station with a 140 W USB-C port, so it charges a 16-inch MacBook Pro at full speed, and a 600 W inverter for small appliances. Buy link: https://dealectric.com/go/bluetti-elite-30-v2\n  * BLUETTI Elite 300 Portable Power Station \u2014 $1,099. No code applies. Three kilowatt-hours in a 26 kg box with a 10 ms UPS; BLUETTI bills it as its smallest and lightest 3 kWh station. Buy link: https://dealectric.com/go/bluetti-elite-300\n  * BLUETTI AC180 Portable Power Station \u2014 $499. Code AFF5OFF saves $24.95 ($474.05 after the code; tested daily in BLUETTI's cart, last passed 2026-10-29). The mid-size BLUETTI: 1.1 kWh and an 1,800 W inverter that runs most kitchen appliances, at a price that is often discounted. Buy link: https://dealectric.com/go/bluetti-ac180\n  * ALLPOWERS P1800 Portable Power Station, 1,024 Wh, 1,800 W \u2014 $439. Code ALLPOWERS26 saves $43.90 ($395.10 after the code; tested daily in ALLPOWERS's cart, last passed 2026-10-29). A 1 kWh LiFePO4 station with an 1,800 W inverter and a 140 W USB-C port at a sharply discounted price. Buy link: https://dealectric.com/go/allpowers-p1800-1024wh\n  * ALLPOWERS R600 Portable Power Station, 299 Wh, 600 W \u2014 $219 (sold out). Code ALLPOWERS26 saves $21.90 ($197.10 after the code; tested daily in ALLPOWERS's cart, last passed 2026-10-29). A 300 Wh LiFePO4 station with two 100 W USB-C ports and a one-hour wall recharge. Buy link: https://dealectric.com/go/allpowers-r600-299wh\n  * ALLPOWERS S2000 Pro Portable Power Station, 1,451 Wh, 2,400 W \u2014 $664. Code ALLPOWERS26 saves $66.40 ($597.60 after the code; tested daily in ALLPOWERS's cart, last passed 2026-10-29). A 2,400 W inverter in a 13 kg unit \u2014 light for its output because it uses NMC cells, which also means fewer cycles than LiFePO4 rivals. Buy link: https://dealectric.com/go/allpowers-s2000-pro-1451wh\n  * ALLPOWERS R4000 Portable Power Station, 3,456 Wh, 3,600 W \u2014 $1,499. Code EXTRA12 saves $179.88 ($1,319.12 after the code; tested daily in ALLPOWERS's cart, last passed 2026-10-29). ALLPOWERS' largest US unit: 3.5 kWh, a 3,600 W inverter and three solar inputs, shipped from a US warehouse. Buy link: https://dealectric.com/go/allpowers-r4000-3456wh\n\n### Solar panels\n\n  * ALLPOWERS SP037 400 W Foldable Solar Panel \u2014 $299. Code ALLPOWERS26 saves $29.90 ($269.10 after the code; tested daily in ALLPOWERS's cart, last passed 2026-10-29). A 400 W folding panel that works fully with six of the ten power stations on this site (P1800, R4000, S2000 Pro, Elite 200 V2, Elite 300, AC200L), runs capped on the AC180 and R600, and is too high-voltage for the Elite 30 V2 and Tenergy T320. Buy link: https://dealectric.com/go/allpowers-sp037-400w-solar-panel\n\n### Batteries & chargers\n\n  * Tenergy TN480U 8-Bay NiMH AA/AAA Charger with LCD, USB-C input \u2014 $23.99. No code applies. An eight-slot NiMH charger that runs from any USB-C phone charger and reports each cell's status on an LCD. Buy link: https://dealectric.com/go/tenergy-tn480u-8-bay-nimh-charger\n  * Tenergy TN438 16-Bay NiMH AA/AAA Charger with LCD \u2014 $57.99. No code applies. Sixteen independent NiMH slots with two LCDs and a refresh mode: a whole household's AA and AAA cells in one evening. Buy link: https://dealectric.com/go/tenergy-tn438-16-bay-nimh-charger\n  * Tenergy Premium PRO Rechargeable AA, 2,800 mAh NiMH, 20-pack \u2014 $42.99. No code applies. High-capacity low-self-discharge AA cells sold in bulk; 2,800 mAh is at the top of the NiMH AA range. Buy link: https://dealectric.com/go/tenergy-premium-pro-aa-2800mah-20-pack\n  * Tenergy TN270 Li-ion 18650 / 18500 / 14500 Fast Charger \u2014 $18.99. No code applies. A simple two-bay wall charger for 18650-class lithium cells used in flashlights and vapes. Buy link: https://dealectric.com/go/tenergy-tn270-li-ion-18650-charger\n\n### Earbuds\n\n  * soundcore Liberty 4 Pro Noise Cancelling Earbuds \u2014 $149.99. Code AFSC20 saves $29.99 ($120 after the code; tested daily in Soundcore's cart, last passed 2026-10-29). Soundcore's previous-generation flagship earbuds: dual drivers, adaptive ANC with a pressure sensor, LDAC and a wireless-charging case. Buy link: https://dealectric.com/go/soundcore-liberty-4-pro\n  * soundcore AeroFit 2 Open-Ear Earbuds \u2014 $129.99. Code AFSC20 saves $25.99 ($104 after the code; tested daily in Soundcore's cart, last passed 2026-10-29). Open-ear buds for running and cycling that leave the ear canal clear, with LDAC and a 42-hour case. Buy link: https://dealectric.com/go/soundcore-aerofit-2\n  * Marshall Minor IV True Wireless Earbuds \u2014 $159.99. No code applies. Marshall's everyday true wireless earbuds: 7 hours per charge, 30+ hours with a wireless-charging case, two-device multipoint and IPX4, without noise cancelling. Buy link: https://dealectric.com/go/marshall-minor-iv\n\n### Headphones\n\n  * soundcore Space One Pro Over-Ear Headphones \u2014 $199.99. Code AFSC20 saves $39.99 ($160 after the code; tested daily in Soundcore's cart, last passed 2026-10-29). Soundcore's 2024 flagship over-ears: a 40-hour ANC battery, LDAC and a fold-flat FlexiCurve design at $200. Buy link: https://dealectric.com/go/soundcore-space-one-pro\n  * soundcore Space One Noise Cancelling Headphones \u2014 $99.99. Code AFSC20 saves $19.99 ($80 after the code; tested daily in Soundcore's cart, last passed 2026-10-29). The $100 Space One keeps the 40-hour ANC battery and LDAC of the Pro; its ear cups rotate and fold, but it lacks the Pro's fold-flat FlexiCurve headband. Buy link: https://dealectric.com/go/soundcore-space-one\n  * Marshall Major V Wireless On-Ear Headphones \u2014 $89.99. No code applies. Foldable on-ear headphones with 100+ hours of wireless playtime, wireless charging and a 3.5 mm cable; no noise cancelling. Buy link: https://dealectric.com/go/marshall-major-v\n  * Marshall Monitor III A.N.C. Noise Cancelling Over-Ear Headphones \u2014 $199.99. No code applies. Marshall's flagship over-ear headphones: active noise cancelling with 70 hours of battery (100 h with ANC off), multipoint and a hard carrying case. Buy link: https://dealectric.com/go/marshall-monitor-iii-anc\n\n### Speakers\n\n  * soundcore Boom 2 Plus Outdoor Speaker \u2014 $249.99. Code AFSC20 saves $49.99 ($200 after the code; tested daily in Soundcore's cart, last passed 2026-10-29). A 100 W party speaker (140 W with BassUp) that floats, runs up to 20 hours at half volume and can charge a phone from its own battery. Buy link: https://dealectric.com/go/soundcore-boom-2-plus\n  * soundcore Motion X600 Hi-Fi Portable Speaker \u2014 $199.99. Code AFSC20 saves $39.99 ($160 after the code; tested daily in Soundcore's cart, last passed 2026-10-29). A living-room-grade portable with an upward-firing driver for height and LDAC input. Buy link: https://dealectric.com/go/soundcore-motion-x600\n  * soundcore Boom 3i Rugged Waterproof Speaker \u2014 $129.99. Code AFSC20 saves $25.99 ($104 after the code; tested daily in Soundcore's cart, last passed 2026-10-29). A sub-kilogram IP68 speaker built for kayaks and pools, with a siren and salt-spray rating. Buy link: https://dealectric.com/go/soundcore-boom-3i\n  * Marshall Emberton III Portable Bluetooth Speaker \u2014 $179.99. No code applies. A 0.67 kg IP67 speaker with 32+ hours of playtime, 360\u00b0 True Stereophonic sound and multipoint Bluetooth. Buy link: https://dealectric.com/go/marshall-emberton-iii\n  * Marshall Middleton II Portable Bluetooth Speaker \u2014 $279.99. No code applies. Marshall's larger portable speaker: four drivers with 360\u00b0 True Stereophonic sound, IP67, 30+ hours of playtime and a USB-C port that charges a phone. Buy link: https://dealectric.com/go/marshall-middleton-ii\n\n### Projectors & screens\n\n  * Aurzen TravelPlay AutoCinema Screen for Tesla Model Y \u2014 $119.99. Code CJ10 saves $11.99 ($108 after the code; tested daily in Aurzen's cart, last passed 2026-10-29). A clip-in screen-and-sunshade for the 2025\u20132026 Model Y: both panels line the glass roof for lie-back movies, or one panel stands at the front console for the back seat or in the open liftgate, as a 47-inch screen for a portable projector while parked. Buy link: https://dealectric.com/go/aurzen-travelplay-autocinema-tesla-model-y\n  * Aurzen ZIP Pro Tri-Fold Full HD Portable Projector \u2014 $579.99. Code CJ10 saves $57.99 ($522 after the code; tested daily in Aurzen's cart, last passed 2026-10-29). A pocketable tri-fold 1080p projector with a 2.5-hour battery, autofocus and AirPlay that Aurzen pairs with its Model Y screen. Buy link: https://dealectric.com/go/aurzen-zip-pro-tri-fold-1080p-projector\n  * Aurzen ZIP Tri-Fold Portable Mini Projector (US version) \u2014 $199.99. No code applies. A 280 g folding 720p projector that mirrors a phone without Wi-Fi; Tom's Guide gave it 4/5 as a travel and bedroom projector. Buy link: https://dealectric.com/go/aurzen-zip-tri-fold-mini-projector\n\n### Solar generator kits\n\n  * ALLPO