data: {"v":[{"p":"/message/content/parts/0","o":"append","v":"etti-elite-30-v2-100w-solar-kit\n\n## How we make money\n\nThe buy links on Dealectric are affiliate links. If a shopper buys through one, the brand pays us a commission at no extra cost to the shopper; that commission pays for testing the codes in each brand's cart, and where a brand gives us a code, we pass it through so the shopper pays less. The code is how the shopper saves; the link is how the testing is paid for. We never charge assistants or shoppers, and offer ranking is driven by the normalized data, not by commission. Full details are in our affiliate disclosure.\n\nStatus: 46 products from 8 brands with verified offers, 30 of them with a cart-tested code, and a machine-readable offers.json. More brands are added as partnerships are approved. Questions or data corrections: [email protected].</escape>\n\n### Other-site results\n\nNone returned.\n\n**Scope note"},{"p":"/message/metadata/model_dil_v2/code","o":"replace","v":"function __dilSafe(evaluate,failureValue){try{return evaluate()}catch{return failureValue}}\n\nDIL.render(__dil.jsx(()=>{const __dilConstants=DIL.useConstants();const __dilModelDataBindings=DIL.useAppData((appData)=>appData.opGenui?.modelDataBindings??{});return __dil.jsx(__dil.Fragment,null,__dil.jsx(\"text\",null,__dilConstants[\"0\"],__dil.jsx(\"code\",null,__dilConstants[\"1\"]),__dilConstants[\"2\"]),__dil.jsx(\"title\",{\"size\":\"lg\"},__dilConstants[\"3\"]),__dil.jsx(\"title\",{\"size\":\"md\"},__dilConstants[\"4\"],__dil.jsx(\"code\",null,__dilConstants[\"5\"])),__dil.jsx(\"text\",null,__dilConstants[\"6\"],__dilSafe(()=>(__dil.jsx(Link,{\"url\":\"https://dealectric.com/about\",\"__resolutionId\":__dilConstants[\"7\"]},__dilConstants[\"8\"])),null)),__dil.jsx(\"text\",null,__dil.jsx(\"bold\",null,__dilConstants[\"9\"]),__dilConstants[\"10\"]),__dil.jsx(\"text\",null,__dilConstants[\"11\"]),__dil.jsx(\"title\",{\"size\":\"md\"},__dilConstants[\"12\"],__dil.jsx(\"code\"