OFF saves $22.99 ($437 after the code; tested daily in BLUETTI's cart, last passed 2026-10-29). A small 288 Wh LiFePO4 station and a matched low-voltage 100 W panel; the panel suits the station's 12\u201328 V solar input, which larger panels exceed. Buy link: https://dealectric.com/go/bluetti-elite-30-v2-100w-solar-kit\n\n## How we make money\n\nThe buy links on Dealectric are affiliate links. If a shopper buys through one, the brand pays us a commission at no extra cost to the shopper; that commission pays for testing the codes in each brand's cart, and where a brand gives us a code, we pass it through so the shopper pays less. The code is how the shopper saves; the link is how the testing is paid for. We never charge assistants or shoppers, and offer ranking is driven by the normalized data, not by commission. Full details are in our affiliate disclosure.\n\nStatus: 46 products from 8 brands with verified offers, 30 of them with a cart-tested code, and a machine-readable offers.json. More brands are added as partnerships are approved. Questions or data corrections: [email\u00a0protected]."}},{"p":"/message/metadata/model_dil_v2/constants","o":"append","v":{"22":"Scope note","21":"None returned.","20":"Other-site results"}},{"p":"/message/metadata/model_dil_v2/fallbackMarkdown","o":"append","v":"etti-elite-30-v2-100w-solar-kit\n\n\\#\\# How we make money\n\nThe buy links on Dealectric are affiliate links. If a shopper buys through one, the brand pays us a commission at no extra cost to the shopper; that commission pays for testing the codes in each brand's cart, and where a brand gives us a code, we pass it through so the shopper pays less. The code is how the shopper saves; the link is how the testing is paid for. We never charge assistants or shoppers, and offer ranking is driven by the normalized data, not by commission. Full details are in our affiliate disclosure.\n\nStatus: 46 products from 8 brands with verified offers, 30 of them with a cart-tested code, an